WEBVTT

00:00:25.521 --> 00:00:30.151
I thought a gender fairy would arrive
and say, “OK, the time has come.”

00:00:30.193 --> 00:00:33.196
But alas, no gender fairy arrived.

00:00:33.654 --> 00:00:35.573
So I just lived my life.

00:00:35.573 --> 00:00:37.950
I didn't hate being a boy.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.744
I just knew I wasn't one.

00:00:40.078 --> 00:00:43.623
Went to college, got married,
had kids, built a career.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.754
But the call toward authenticity
has all the subtlety of a smoke alarm.

00:00:49.796 --> 00:00:50.797
(Laughter)

00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:53.174
And eventually decisions have to be made.

00:00:53.883 --> 00:00:55.968
So I came out as transgender,

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.513
and I lost all of my jobs.

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:01.390
I had never had a bad review,